AArch64 lane-need-unfenced
"the consumer stores rpos (a), fences, loads need (b); the producer stores need, fences, loads rpos: one load sees the other store; without its fences, which must fail"
{
0:X1=a; 0:X3=b;
1:X1=a; 1:X3=b;
}
 P0           | P1 ;
 MOV W0,#16   | MOV W0,#16 ;
 STLR W0,[X1] | STLR W0,[X3] ;
 LDR W2,[X3]  | LDAR W2,[X1] ;
exists (0:X2=0 /\ 1:X2=0)
